Privacy Policy for Creative Audio - SkuVault QC Serializer
Last Updated: September 28, 2026

Introduction
This Privacy Policy describes how the Creative Audio - SkuVault QC Serializer browser extension ("the extension", "we", "us") handles information. The extension is an internal tool for Creative Audio warehouse staff. It records product serial numbers while orders are checked on the SkuVault Quality Control page.

Where the Extension Runs
The extension only runs on the SkuVault Quality Control page (https://app.skuvault.com/sales/qualitycontrol). It does not read, collect or track anything on any other website.

Information the Extension Handles
Order details shown on the Quality Control page: the Order ID, product SKUs, product codes (UPCs) and the quantities left to check. The extension reads these from the page to work out which items need serial numbers.
Serial numbers: the serial numbers staff scan or type into the extension.
The extension does not collect names, email addresses, customer details, passwords, payment information or browsing history.

How the Information Is Used
To look up each product's price and decide whether it requires a serial number.
To check which serial numbers are already on file for an order.
To save scanned serial numbers against the order, for warranty, returns and inventory records.
Where the Information Is Sent
Order IDs, SKUs and serial numbers are sent over HTTPS only to Creative Audio's own internal server (driven.synology.me). They are not sent anywhere else.

We do not sell, rent or share this information with third parties, and it is not used for advertising.

The extension does not change any data in SkuVault through SkuVault's API. Its only effect on the SkuVault page is what staff could do by hand: entering the quantity and pressing Pass after serial numbers are saved.

Data Storage
The extension itself stores nothing on the computer. Serial number records are kept on Creative Audio's internal server and retained for as long as they are needed for warranty, returns and inventory purposes.

Your Choices
Removing the extension from Chrome stops it from reading or sending any information.

Changes to This Policy
If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted here with a new "Last Updated" date.

Contact
Questions about this policy can be sent to aabel@creativeaudio.net.
